    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Critical Creative Innovative Thinking (CCIT) Forum was represented at the esteemed  World Incubation Summit  held in Ghent, Belgium in May 2023. The global event brought together over 180 incubators from more than 40 countries, providing a dynamic platform for thought leaders to discuss innovation in the startup ecosystem for socio-economic growth.",
